    {
      "text": "I persuade my brethren, that they might be faithful, 1 Ne. 3:21. mine intent is that I may persuade men to come, 1 Ne. 6:4. that I might more fully persuade them to believe, 1 Ne. 19:23. write, to persuade our children … to believe, 2 Ne. 25:23. it persuadeth them to do good, 2 Ne. 33:4 (Ether 4:11). I would that I could persuade all … to repent, Morm. 3:22. persuaded that Jesus is the Christ, Morm. 5:14. persuaded to do good continually, Ether 8:26. to persuade to believe in Christ, Moro. 7:16. devil … persuadeth no man to do good, Moro. 7:17.",
